# LaTeX build artifacts. Scoped to the paper directory on purpose: a bare
# *.pdf would also exclude docs/IEEE Paper/figures/*.pdf, which are build
# INPUTS generated by src/ml/plot_paper.py and must stay tracked.
docs/IEEE Paper/*.aux
docs/IEEE Paper/*.bbl
docs/IEEE Paper/*.blg
docs/IEEE Paper/*.log
docs/IEEE Paper/*.out
docs/IEEE Paper/*.toc
docs/IEEE Paper/*.lof
docs/IEEE Paper/*.lot
docs/IEEE Paper/*.fls
docs/IEEE Paper/*.fdb_latexmk
docs/IEEE Paper/*.synctex.gz
docs/IEEE Paper/main.pdf